/**
@dir bmq

@brief The `BMQ` (BlazingMQ) package group provides the public SDK API for the
BlazingMQ framework.

The `bmq` package group is a message-queue framework allowing application
developers to use reliable distributed queues.

The `bmqa` and `bmqt` packages contain all components that constitute the public
API for BlazingMQ users. A client should only use the components in these
packages, and should not use any other package under the `bmq` package group,
since they are implementation components that may change at any time.
*/
